OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will get off to a
OL,6,Frather cloudy start perhaps with the
OL,7,Fodd spot of drizzle. However, skies
OL,8,Fwill brighten from the south during
OL,9,Fthe morning allowing warm sunshine to
OL,10,Fdevelop. Cloud beginning to increase
OL,11,Fagain later. Humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will thicken from the
OL,14,Fsouth during the evening with some
OL,15,Fshowers breaking out. These will give
OL,16,Fway to some heavier and more
OL,17,Fpersistent outbreaks of rain overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
