OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday will start cloudy
OL,6,Fwith some lingering patchy rain. Skies
OL,7,Fwill brighten through the morning,
OL,8,Fespecially in the east, though one or
OL,9,Ftwo showers could break out during the
OL,10,Fday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday will be cooler and breezy
OL,14,Fwith sunshine and scattered showers.
OL,15,FPerhaps more persistent rain later.
OL,16,FBecoming drier and less breezy to end
OL,17,Fthe week with some sunshine, though
OL,18,Ffresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
